WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.343
Meet Priya.

2
00:00:05.693 --> 00:00:09.383
She runs finance operations
at a fast-growing company,

3
00:00:09.423 --> 00:00:12.473
where AI agents now work
alongside her team,

4
00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:16.247
issuing refunds, updating
records and approving payments.

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.264
The agents are fast.

6
00:00:18.564 --> 00:00:21.035
But they act on whatever
access they were given.

7
00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:24.272
Nobody checks first,
and nothing records why.

8
00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:28.873
Then, one Friday night,
an agent misreads a request,

9
00:00:28.913 --> 00:00:31.229
and refunds 900,000 dirhams.

10
00:00:31.579 --> 00:00:34.572
Another exports 38,000 customer records.

11
00:00:35.122 --> 00:00:38.028
On Monday, the auditors ask:
who approved this?

12
00:00:38.428 --> 00:00:39.636
Nobody did.

13
00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.990
That's why we built AgentPermit:

14
00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:47.091
a checkpoint between your
AI agents and your systems.

15
00:00:47.491 --> 00:00:49.924
Every agent, explicitly permitted.

16
00:00:50.867 --> 00:00:52.009
Here's how it works.

17
00:00:52.359 --> 00:00:54.609
First, onboard your agents.

18
00:00:54.649 --> 00:00:57.549
AgentPermit finds them in Copilot Studio,

19
00:00:57.589 --> 00:00:59.934
and gives each one a verified identity,

20
00:00:59.974 --> 00:01:02.787
so no agent can pass
itself off as another.

21
00:01:05.433 --> 00:01:07.564
Then put the gateway in front of them:

22
00:01:07.604 --> 00:01:12.617
one action in Copilot Studio,
one API call in code, or MCP.

23
00:01:12.967 --> 00:01:17.468
And lock the door, so your systems
only take actions through AgentPermit.

24
00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:24.489
Next, set your rules in plain words:
allow it, ask me first, or stop it.

25
00:01:24.839 --> 00:01:29.695
Publish, and they're signed and live at
once. Anything no rule covers is stopped.

26
00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:36.008
Each agent starts by learning,
then testing, then goes live.

27
00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:39.814
Now every request runs nine checks.

28
00:01:40.114 --> 00:01:43.884
Routine actions go straight through,
risky ones are stopped,

29
00:01:43.924 --> 00:01:46.678
and anything in between
waits for a named person.

30
00:01:48.733 --> 00:01:52.448
So when an agent tries to
refund 900,000 dirhams,

31
00:01:52.488 --> 00:01:55.472
Priya gets the request in Teams,
and rejects it.

32
00:01:55.872 --> 00:01:57.084
Nothing runs.

33
00:01:58.533 --> 00:02:00.917
Agents never hold the
keys to your systems.

34
00:02:01.217 --> 00:02:03.417
And every decision leaves a signed,

35
00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:06.798
chained receipt that auditors
can verify on their own.

36
00:02:08.633 --> 00:02:10.238
And you watch it all live:

37
00:02:10.278 --> 00:02:12.753
today's activity,
what needs your sign-off,

38
00:02:12.793 --> 00:02:14.395
and a trace of every decision.

39
00:02:14.745 --> 00:02:17.490
If an agent suddenly does
far more than usual,

40
00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:20.903
it's stopped on its own,
and one switch pauses them all.

41
00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:27.757
Verified identities,
plain-language rules, human sign-off,

42
00:02:27.797 --> 00:02:30.137
runaway protection and signed receipts,

43
00:02:30.177 --> 00:02:32.356
all running in your own Azure tenant.

44
00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.595
So your agents reach production sooner,

45
00:02:36.635 --> 00:02:39.124
because security and
risk teams can say yes.

46
00:02:39.624 --> 00:02:42.083
Costly mistakes are stopped
before they happen.

47
00:02:42.583 --> 00:02:44.896
Auditors get signed proof, not guesswork.

48
00:02:45.396 --> 00:02:47.319
And everyday work keeps flowing.

49
00:02:49.517 --> 00:02:51.522
Use it wherever agents move money,

50
00:02:51.562 --> 00:02:54.282
change access or touch sensitive data:

51
00:02:54.322 --> 00:02:58.860
in finance, banking, HR, IT,
healthcare and procurement.

52
00:03:02.767 --> 00:03:04.520
AgentPermit, from Plinthera.

53
00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:07.003
Every agent, explicitly permitted.

54
00:03:07.352 --> 00:03:08.636
Book your demo today.
